(7733460, 1274524, 75585, '<td valign="top">There is a lot going on in this photo, the color is VERY November, but I am not drawn to any one element as there is a lot.  Sometimes giving the eye a place to rest in an image is as important to the scene as subjects are.</td>', 'There is a lot going on in this photo, the color is VERY November, but I am not drawn to any one element as there is a lot.  Sometimes giving the eye a place to rest in an image is as important to the scene as subjects are.', '2022-11-28 15:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
