be trusted!  LOL.   thats so funny .. about the treats .. ;) maybe I will be able to get mr tod to pose like your pup one of these days .. I need to be more consistent with training tho .. he''s the smart one in the relationship ..  what''s your pup''s name btw .. :)   This is Sawyer  sometimes Soy Sauce.  He loves it a lot.  Lots and lots of treats in the beginning, and an extra set of hands is helpful in the beginning.  There are many times where I still need help for sure and it can be frustrating as heck sometimes.  ', '2022-12-05 00:35:27.000000', NULL, 0),
